text:
BREAKING: The largest rally of Iranians in history of Melbourne, Australia, has just taken place for the Global Day of Action, a call to action by Iran’s exiled Shah and National Leader, Reza Shah Pahlavi II [
@PahlaviReza
]. Iranians are holding massive portraits of Reza Shah II

